/*
 * Notifications applet: resources
 *
 * The Ukrainian texts are Windows 10's (Windows.UI.SettingsAppThreshold
 * and SettingsHandlers-nt, uk-UA) where it has them; what Arctic's applet
 * has of its own (no action center, no lock screen) is Arctic's.
